  "goodToKnow": "Das Grabmal is a tomb or funerary monument, larger and grander than a simple Grabstein (gravestone): das Grabmal Theoderichs in Ravenna, the Kaisergräber in Speyer Cathedral. Germany's central memorial to the victims of war and tyranny is the Neue Wache in Berlin. Das Mal here means mark or monument, as in das Denkmal. Plural: die Grabmäler or Grabmale."
